e:** `serde_json::to_value(secret)` is asserted equal to `\"an-explicit-secret\"`. A JSON string deserialized into a `SecretString` is asserted equal to the original, which covers `Deserialize` and a round trip.\n- **Trait implementations:**\n  - `Clone` is exercised by `secret.clone()` and compared.\n  - `PartialEq` is checked in both directions: `assert_eq` for equal values and `assert_ne` against `\"another value\"`.\n  - `Eq` is a marker trait with no behavior of its own, so it needs no behavioral test.\n- **Public surface:** `crates/trust-but-verify/tests/public_api.rs#fn[public_exports_match_the_appendix]` checks the exported inventory against the documented appendix.\n\nI found no requirement-violating behavior that these tests would accept.",
